            The all-in-one enterprise platform that combines AI-powered project management, real-time collaboration, and predictive analytics to deliver projects on time and under budget.
          </p>
          <div className="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <Button size="lg" className="bg-accent hover:bg-accent/90 text-primary-foreground font-semibold h-12 px-8 text-base">
              Start Free Trial <ArrowRight className="ml-2 w-4 h-4" />
